      "subsections": {
        "OVERVIEW": {
          "present": true,
          "status": "content",
          "source_heading": "OVERVIEW",
          "canonical_heading": "OVERVIEW",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Tumors of endocrine cells that are capable of amine precursor uptake and decarboxylation (APUD) and secretion of",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "peptide hormones.",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "APUD cells are generally found in gastrointestinal tract and",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "CNS.",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Hypergastrinemia from gastrinsecreting tumors (gastrinomas) causes gastritis and duodenal hyperacidity, which can cause gastric ulceration, gastric mucosal hypertrophy, esophageal dysfunction (chronic reflux), and intestinal villous atrophy.",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Polypeptide-secreting tumors (polypeptidomas) may not cause clinical signs, but high concentration of pancreatic polypeptide may cause gastric hyperacidity and gastrointestinal ulceration.",
              "pdf_page": 193,
              "printed_page": 111,
              "column": 1
            }
          ]
        },
